### Summary of what changed and why

| File | What changed | Why |
|---|---|---|
| `EmergencyService.java` | Outbox write in same `@Transactional` as DB save | Fixes dual-write data loss |
| `OutboxEvent.java` + `OutboxEventRepository.java` | New | Required for outbox pattern |
| `OutboxPublisher.java` | New background publisher with retry + cleanup | Replaces fire-and-forget Kafka send |
| `DispatchListener.java` | Catches `JsonProcessingException` internally | Prevents infinite Kafka retry loop |
| `AmbulanceAssignmentListener.java` | No throws, reads version fresh in lambdas, guard on `activeEmergencyId` | Fixes silent transition failures + infinite retry |
| `DispatchEngine.requeueEmergency()` | Saves payload at enqueue, restores it on requeue | Fixes orphaned emergency bug |
| `AmbulanceStateTracker.transition()` | Replaced `synchronized` + multi-setters with Lua script | Fixes false atomicity across JVM instances |
| `application.yml` (api-gateway) | Restricted Actuator to safe endpoints | Prevents secrets/shutdown exposure |
| `CorsConfig.java` | Origins loaded from config, supports local dev | Unblocks local development |
| `AmbulanceMovementSimulator.java` | `@PostConstruct` init, iterative `moveAlongRoute` | Fixes wasteful re-init + stack overflow risk |
| `docker-compose.yml` + `.env` | Credentials in `.env` | Removes secrets from version control |